window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Accepting this vision as fate would be my ruin.</p> <p>I may be an immortal psychic, but having a vision that the Horseman of Death will rise and claim my soulmate’s life really puts a crimp in my style. I mean, I just got him back.</p> <p>Apollo has to know I’ll do everything in my power to stop it.</p> <p>But no matter what I do, I can’t seem to push my abilities to give me specifics. Each time I try, it’s like my energy is siphoned and it takes me days to get back on my feet. Neat-o.</p> <p>Add on top, we’re trying to keep the Gemini Twins, Colton and Cat, from self-destructing–or worse, getting taken by Sentinel.</p> <p>Unfortunately, my rag-tag team is having problems of their own, so they’re zero help. Everything around me is falling apart and I can’t let it happen.</p> <p>Come hell or high water, I will find a way to hold this group of misfits together–and good luck to anyone who tries to stand in my way.</p>"; 
